	"system": {
		"description": "<p>The target gains one of the following benefits, chosen when you manifest this power:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Lungs.</strong> The target doubles the amount of time it can hold its breath.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gut.</strong> The target has advantage on saving throws made against poison.</p></li><li><p><strong>Skin.</strong> The target’s AC increases by 1.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Surge.</strong> You can spend +1 psionic point per creature to affect up to 4 targets [requires power rating equal to the total number of creatures affected].</p>",
